        <item>
            <title>0.2.6</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v0.2.6</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Matched sub2api usage logs with local sessions by <code>session_id</code> to override local pricing with server-side tier/effort rewrites and Free Fast billing.</li>
                    <li>Added automatic syncing and recording of current-day and historical sub2api usage logs into local metric history.</li>
                    <li>Added progress feedback and cancellation support when rebuilding the historical metrics index.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
